---Retry a run
---
---Starts the next attempt of a failed, timed-out or canceled run from its snapshot, verbatim — whatever the agent has become since, archived excepted — attributed to the caller. The repository must still be the project's here, the agent must still be unarchived and select it, and the Change must still be the Trail's. Project read access admits the caller; anyone else reads the project as not found. A repository's readers act through its own run routes (/repos/{repo_id}/runs). Requires push on the repository (automation principals also project write or manage); without canManageAgents only an enabled agent runs. Served only by the project's primary processing cell.
---
---`POST /api/v1/{host}/{project}/runs/{id}/retry`
---@param input entire.runs.RetryProjectRunRequest
---@return entire.runs.Run? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:retry_project_run(input) end

